{"type":"theorem","type_name":"Theorem","number":"1.4.1","title":"Consistency and the general solution","title_html":"Consistency and the general solution","html":"<p>Let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{G}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">G</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be any generalized\ninverse of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. The following are\nequivalent:</p>\n<div class=\"enumerate\" data-options=\"label=(\\alph*)\">\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{x}=\\mathbf{b}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is\nconsistent;</p></li>\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{b}\\in\\mathcal{C}(\\mathbf{A})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c43 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>;</p></li>\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}[\\mathbf{A},\\mathbf{b}]=\\operatorname{rank}(\\mathbf{A})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rank</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>rank</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>;</p></li>\n<li><p><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{G}\\mathbf{b}=\\mathbf{b}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">G</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<p>If the system is consistent, <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{x}_0=\\mathbf{G}\\mathbf{b}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">G</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is a solution, and the set of\nall solutions is <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\{\\mathbf{G}\\mathbf{b}+(\\mathbf{I}-\\mathbf{G}\\mathbf{A})\\mathbf{z}:\\mathbf{z}\\in\\mathbb{R}^n\\}=\\mathbf{x}_0+\\mathcal{N}(\\mathbf{A}).\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D408 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D406 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D400 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D433 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo>